From baa56d14b511ddb3c4054c07a33d094bc2b3551b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Z User <z@container>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 18:18:39 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/5] feat: parser QA fixes, backup restore, activity log,
 WhatsApp statements, offline drafts, PWA
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- parser: fix 6 failing real-world patterns found by a 22-case QA battery
  (gave/collected/mila/vasool as payment verbs; customer fallback scan for
  lines that don't start with the name, e.g. 'Rs 120 udhaar Ramesh')
- restore: POST /api/import (merge/replace) with row-by-row validation and
  balances always recomputed from ledger lines; Settings UI with confirm
  dialog; fixes 5s tx timeout + SQLite deadlock (tx-scoped settings upsert)
- audit: GET /api/audit + append-only Activity log card in Settings
- statements: POST /api/customers/[name]/statement — WhatsApp-ready receipt
  built from real ledger lines; 'Send statement' in customer sheet
- offline: honest offline banner + draft persistence in localStorage
  (typed sentence and manual form survive reloads; no fake offline sync)
- PWA: manifest, khata-themed SVG/PNG icons, theme color, apple-web-app

Verified: parser battery 22/22, export->merge->replace roundtrip via curl,
browser E2E (entry, restore dialog, statement wa.me link, offline banner,
draft reload, mobile 390x844 layout, sticky footer), eslint clean
